We knew that was the inevitable end state,

1406
01:11:56,456 --> 01:11:59,654
但显然需要做一堆工作，还有各种取舍
but there's obviously a bunch of like work that was needed and tradeoffs

1407
01:11:59,654 --> 01:12:01,360
只是没人愿意拍板
and just no one wanted to make the call.

1408
01:12:01,480 --> 01:12:05,160
于是就又来一轮设计冲刺，又来一个周期
